  "label": "Anti-White Stereotype: Rowdiness as a Marker of 'Natural' Behavior",
  "description": "This stereotype suggests that white people are inherently wild or uninhibited, especially after consuming alcohol. This is a harmful trope that reinforces racial hierarchies by implying that white people are naturally rowdy, which is not true and is used to demean or stereotype them.",
